    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality. watching them try to manage my appointments and my physical stuff on top of their own lives... it just feels selfish to keep taking up so much of their time and energy. it's like i'm just a problem they're constantly trying to solve.",
